              "heading": "Cancel Your Booking with CloudWay 24"
            },
            "text": "CloudWay 24 aims to provide passengers with flexibility and control over their travel plans. If you need to cancel your booking for any reason, our streamlined process ensures a hassle-free experience both online and via our mobile app."
          }
        ],
        "sections": [
          {
